'''Depths of My Heart''' (魂底からの帰化, ''Kontei Kara no Kika'', '''Naturalization from the Bottom of the Soul''') is the 12th sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]], and the 61st sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 8.4 Update|Version 8.4]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter bears similarities to [[Neverending Cat Story]] with most of it being very easy since the stages have enemies that are easy to beat on their own. However, [[Woods of Resentment]] can be a challenge without [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cheerleader Cat]]'s [[True Form]], and [[Primitive Souls]] is quite difficult overall, being amongst the harder stages in [[Uncanny Legends]].
{{LegendDiff|140|180|100}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces 1 new enemy:
*[[Dogumaru (Enemy)|Dogumaru]]: A long-ranged [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemy similar to [[Manic King Dragon (Enemy)|Manic King Dragon]]. Deals moderate damage with each attack, and has Omni Strike and a 100% chance to Curse cats for 20 seconds.

This sub-chapter includes a new obtainable character, [[Dogumaru (Special Cat)|Dogumaru]], which is found in the last stage of this sub-chapter. It has a 30% chance to drop (100% if a [[Treasure Radar]] is used).

